01:31:03.790 --> 01:31:06.194
There's something
in there! In there!

1024
01:31:06.260 --> 01:31:07.962
Elise!

1025
01:31:08.028 --> 01:31:10.163
Steven. Lorraine.
go check on Dalton.

1026
01:31:10.230 --> 01:31:10.230
SPECS: What?

1027
01:31:10.230 --> 01:31:12.132
Go check on Dalton.

1028
01:31:12.199 --> 01:31:12.199
What?

1029
01:31:12.199 --> 01:31:14.335
Go check on Dalton now!

1030
01:31:23.610 --> 01:31:25.279
(HEART MONITOR BEEPING)

1031
01:31:35.122 --> 01:31:36.491
(SPECS SCREAMING)

1032
01:31:46.033 --> 01:31:47.635
(BABY MONITOR EMITS STATIC)

1033
01:31:57.611 --> 01:31:59.080
(STATIC CONTINUES)

1034
01:32:04.084 --> 01:32:06.153
They're crossing over
into our world.

1035
01:32:07.088 --> 01:32:08.422
(DOOR CREAKING)

1036
01:32:22.836 --> 01:32:22.836
Elise!

1037
01:32:22.836 --> 01:32:25.139
ELISE: Tucker!

1038
01:32:25.205 --> 01:32:27.241
No. you have to shine
the light on Josh.

1039
01:32:32.446 --> 01:32:33.747
Come on!

1040
01:32:33.814 --> 01:32:35.116
(GRUNTING)

1041
01:32:35.182 --> 01:32:36.417
Let's go around back.

1042
01:32:36.484 --> 01:32:38.952
Shine the light
on Josh! On Josh!

1043
01:32:39.019 --> 01:32:40.221
Tucker. on Josh!

1044
01:32:40.288 --> 01:32:41.689
You've got
to call him back!

1045
01:32:41.755 --> 01:32:42.856
RENAI: Josh!

1046
01:32:42.923 --> 01:32:46.127
Josh! Josh! Come back
to us. Josh. please!

1047
01:32:48.261 --> 01:32:50.164
Josh! Josh!
Come back. please!

1048
01:32:52.399 --> 01:32:53.634
Come on. Dad!

1049
01:32:53.700 --> 01:32:55.002
Come on.
he's right behind us!

1050
01:32:55.069 --> 01:32:56.236
We have to go!

1051
01:32:56.303 --> 01:32:57.438
I'm right
behind you! Go!

1052
01:33:06.213 --> 01:33:07.281
You.

1053
01:33:17.191 --> 01:33:18.526
(SNARLING)

1054
01:33:52.059 --> 01:33:53.894
What do you
want from me?

1055
01:33:53.961 --> 01:33:55.396
What do you
want from me?

1056
01:33:56.229 --> 01:33:58.432
I'm not scared of you.

1057
01:33:58.499 --> 01:34:00.433
I'm not scared
of you anymore.

1058
01:34:00.500 --> 01:34:02.636
You can get
away from me.

1059
01:34:02.703 --> 01:34:07.307
Get the hell
away from me!
Get away from me!

1060
01:34:07.374 --> 01:34:10.611
Get away from me!
Leave me alone!

1061
01:34:11.512 --> 01:34:13.547
Please. please. please!

1062
01:34:13.614 --> 01:34:15.182
 <i> Come back to us!</i>
 <i> Follow my voice!</i>

1063
01:34:15.248 --> 01:34:17.385
Follow my voice!
Please. honey!

1064
01:34:17.451 --> 01:34:19.153
Josh. come back!
Come back to us!

1065
01:34:19.220 --> 01:34:20.454
Get the hell
away from me!

1066
01:34:22.255 --> 01:34:24.791
Please. Josh. please.
come back to us. please!

1067
01:34:24.858 --> 01:34:28.828
Follow my voice!
Follow my voice! Please!

1068
01:34:28.895 --> 01:34:32.433
 <i> Josh. please!</i>
 <i> Come back. please!</i>

1069
01:34:32.499 --> 01:34:33.834
Leave me alone!

1070
01:34:36.270 --> 01:34:37.438
(GASPING)

1071
01:35:29.389 --> 01:35:31.058
I've got Dalton.
He's awake!

1072
01:35:31.124 --> 01:35:32.793
Oh. my boy!

1073
01:35:32.859 --> 01:35:35.562
He's okay! He's okay!

1074
01:35:35.629 --> 01:35:37.298
JOSH: We did it. buddy.

1075
01:35:45.639 --> 01:35:47.575
You're back. You're back.

1076
01:35:59.019 --> 01:36:00.954
Dude. I got some
amazing shots.

1077
01:36:01.021 --> 01:36:03.624
You're gonna
write a book.

1078
01:36:03.691 --> 01:36:06.193
and my photos
are gonna be the
main selling point.

1079
01:36:07.428 --> 01:36:08.662
Not the main
selling point.

1080
01:36:08.729 --> 01:36:10.297
but they'll
definitely be important.

1081
01:36:10.364 --> 01:36:12.666
They will be important.

1082
01:36:12.733 --> 01:36:14.334
A picture's worth
a thousand words.

1083
01:36:14.401 --> 01:36:17.471
Yeah.
but words are worth
a thousand words. too.

1084
01:36:20.641 --> 01:36:23.176
You're really hungry.
aren't you?

1085
01:36:23.243 --> 01:36:25.245
And I'm tired. too.

1086
01:36:25.311 --> 01:36:28.115
You're tired?
No. you can't be tired.

1087
01:36:28.182 --> 01:36:29.683
Yes. I can.

1088
01:36:29.750 --> 01:36:31.251
No. you've been asleep
for far too long.
And you know what?

1089
01:36:31.318 --> 01:36:32.853
I'm never letting you
go to sleep again.

1090
01:36:35.055 --> 01:36:36.891
You showed me a new world.

1091
01:36:37.691 --> 01:36:39.827
No. I didn't.

1092
01:36:39.894 --> 01:36:42.196
You've been there
before. remember?

1093
01:36:46.533 --> 01:36:48.569
Well. let's hope
I forget again.

1094
01:36:49.770 --> 01:36:51.472
Guess I don't need
these anymore.

1095
01:36:59.045 --> 01:37:00.581
What?

1096
01:37:00.647 --> 01:37:02.449
Nothing.

1097
01:37:02.516 --> 01:37:04.618
I'm gonna
get rid of these.

1098
01:37:05.586 --> 01:37:07.588
All right. (SIGHS)

1099
01:37:20.901 --> 01:37:22.002
Why did you do that?

1100
01:37:23.904 --> 01:37:27.174
Why would you do that
to me when you know
how I feel about that?

1101
01:37:27.241 --> 01:37:29.143
Why? Why?

1102
01:37:29.777 --> 01:37:31.544
Why? Why?

1103
01:37:31.611 --> 01:37:33.746
Why? Why? Why?

1104
01:37:33.813 --> 01:37:35.449
No. you're not tired.

1105
01:37:35.515 --> 01:37:37.551
In fact. you're never
going to sleep again.
You have to stay awake

1106
01:37:37.617 --> 01:37:37.617
for the rest of
your life. with me.

1107
01:37:37.617 --> 01:37:39.086
No.

1108
01:37:39.153 --> 01:37:40.253
(CHOKING)

1109
01:37:40.320 --> 01:37:42.156
Why? Why? Why?

1110
01:37:44.858 --> 01:37:46.360
(JOSH YELLING)

1111
01:37:49.263 --> 01:37:50.865
You bitch!

1112
01:37:56.103 --> 01:37:57.371
Can you watch him.
Lorraine?

1113
01:37:57.438 --> 01:37:58.639
Sure.

1114
01:38:02.576 --> 01:38:03.811
Elise.

1115
01:38:06.013 --> 01:38:07.214
(GASPS)

1116
01:38:12.385 --> 01:38:14.922
Josh! Josh!

1117
01:38:16.890 --> 01:38:18.659
Josh. where are you?

1118
01:38:19.660 --> 01:38:21.061
Josh!

1119
01:38:22.663 --> 01:38:24.798
Honey. please! Josh!

1120
01:38:29.470 --> 01:38:30.738
Josh?

1121
01:38:33.840 --> 01:38:35.342
Oh. Jesus.

1122
01:39:01.768 --> 01:39:03.136
JOSH: Renai.

1123
01:39:03.203 --> 01:39:04.405
I'm right here.

1124
01:39:04.838 --> 01:39:05.773
(GASPS)
